{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1569888000, "end_date": 1570579199, "month_true_total": 496, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:20:15 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55513996", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970278620", "personaname": "Hans Olo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970278620/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 44743, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42277, "last_played": 1777220694, "avatar": "71c3f1e904d6f5b4e724ddb15a67c6fca4b49691"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game itself is pretty awesome alright, although the amount and variety of content could be much better. The player base is generally friendly, just not necessarily on the forums, where the 2000+ hour professional forum trolls spend most of their lives. It's like some sort of troll country club. Everyone is nice until you fall out of line and express an unpopular opinion, like giving negative feedback. Then they collectively turn on you and troll you hard, until the furious clown-moderator, whose purpose in life is failing miserably at moderating the DRG forum when he isn't playing DRG or collecting dwarf action figures, which isn't creepy at all, finishes you off with a month-long ban for defending yourself against the insults without any prior misbehavior (real or made up) whatsoever in order to win his troll pals' respect, because it's the only thing that keeps him going. When he is done abusing his special moderator powers, he shows character by not responding to any messages concerning the ban and blocking communications with you, while leaving your topic unlocked, so his troll pals can continue doing what they do best.", "timestamp_created": 1570558884, "timestamp_updated": 1666625085, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55509895", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060839523", "personaname": "Business Goose", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060839523/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 855, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 558, "last_played": 1685480314, "avatar": "90dca1abd6eb9d38e2a8a03bde2bb8cc22721bfd"}, "language": "english", "review": "honestly ROCK AND STONE brothers. \n\nIt may feel a little repetitive at first, but the caves become much cooler quite soon and you will find upgrading your equipment really satisfying for in-game impact.\n\nPlay with your mates its 10000x better -  different classes really feel like they complement each other. \n\nDecent updates aswell, the devs seem pretty on it with new content :) \n\nROCK AND STONE BROTHER", "timestamp_created": 1570541825, "timestamp_updated": 1570541825, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493589729070663452", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55509407", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014426414", "personaname": "YOU LOVE DD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198014426414/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 5591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1939, "last_played": 1775688821, "avatar": "21a850e6dc92be996c3022c7a6f383bbf41976d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game even better with friends!", "timestamp_created": 1570539470, "timestamp_u